<title>TUNISIA: Tunis Air to launch Tunis-Istanbul service.</title>
<headline>Tunis Air to launch Tunis-Istanbul service.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's airliner Tunis Air announced on Monday it will start on March 30 its first weekly service between the Tunisian island of Jerba and Istanbul.</p>
<p>The regular flight will be each Friday.</p>
<p>The carrier already has two weekly flights between Tunis and Istanbul, each Tuesday and Thursday.</p>
